##Title: VSapp - Vacation Scheduling Application

## Purpose:
VSapp is a comprehensive vacation planning and management application for Android devices. The
application allows users to organize their vacations by creating detailed vacation records,
adding associated excursions, setting alerts for important dates, and sharing vacation details with
others.

## Operating Instructions:

## Navigation Structure
1) Main Activity - Welcome screen with entry button
2) Vacation List - Displays all created vacations
3) Vacation Details - Edit vacation information and view associated excursions
4) Excursion Details - Create and edit individual excursions

## Getting Started
1) Launch the application and tap "Enter" on the welcome screen to reach the Vacation List
screen. All created vacations will appear on the Vacation List screen.

2) To add sample data (two vacations with two excursions each), click on the three dots at the top
right corner of the menu bar. Once you hit the back button, go to the Main Activity screen and
press enter again. The sample data will now be displayed.

## Managing Vacations

## Creating New Vacations

1) Tap the floating action button (+) on the Vacation List screen
2) Enter vacation title and hotel name
3) Select start and end dates using the date picker buttons
4) Click "Save Vacation" from the three-button menu to save changes
*Validation: End dates must be after start dates for vacations

## Editing/Deleting Vacations:

1) Tap on any vacation in the list to open details
2) Modify fields as needed
3) Select "Save Vacation" from the three-button menu to save changes
4) Select "Delete Vacation" from the three-button menu to save changes
*Validation: Vacations with associated excursions cannot be deleted

##Managing Excursions
##Adding New Excursions:

1) Open a vacation's details page
2) Tap the floating action button (+) in the excursion section
3) Enter excursion title and select date from the data picker buttons
4) Save using "Save Excursion" from the three-button menu
*Validation: Excursion dates must fall within the vacation's date range

##Editing/Deleting Excursions:

1) Tap on any excursion in the vacation details list
2) Modify title or date as needed
3) Use menu options to save changes or delete the excursion

##Setting Alerts
##Vacation Alerts:

1) Open vacation details
2) Select "Alert Both" from the three-button menu to set notifications for both start and end dates

## Excursion Alerts:

1) Open any excursion details
2) Select "Set Alert" from the three-button menu to receive notification on the excursion date

## Sharing Vacations

1) Open vacation details
2) Select "Share Vacation" from the three-button menu
3) Choose your preferred sharing method (email, messaging, etc.)
(The shared content includes all vacation details and associated excursions)


## Rubric Requirements Reached
Android Version for signed APK: Compatible with Android 8.0 and higher
Uses Room Framework for database abstraction
Implements all required CRUD operations accessible from the main user interface
Includes comprehensive data validation
Provides alert/notification functionality
Supports sharing capabilities

